text @[Teacher]
text Sunohara!
text The teacher calls a student's name.
sound 13.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Absent as usual?
text I look to my side where Sunohara's desk sits empty.
text His attendance rate is even worse than mine.
text You see, the two of us are often labeled as the "delinquents" at school.
text But that's probably why we get along so well.
text He's really the only person in class I can have an honest conversation with.
text Nevertheless, today's classes begin.
text I spend them looking out the window.
text The teachers' voices go in one ear and out the other.
