text Classes finish, bringing the school day to an end.
text Sunohara never did show.
text In fact, the only person I've spoken to all day is that girl from this morning.
text It really is just another ordinary day.
text Since I'm not part of any after-school club, I grab my empty bag, cut through a pack of jabbering students, and leave the classroom.
setvar strS[1000] = "BG033Y"
