text I could go home, but there wouldn't be anyone else there at this hour. Not anyone I'd want to see, anyway.
text I don't have a mother.
text I was told that she died in a car accident when I was still little. I don't even remember what she looks like.
text After her passing, my father sank into a pretty deep depression, probably due to the shock of it all.
text Using alcohol to numb his pain, he wasted away his days gambling.
text Because of that, a lot of my time as a kid was spent arguing with him, actually.
setvar strS[1000] = "BG031Y"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s17
fi
goto 19
label s17
setvar strS[1000] = ""
