		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text It'd be better if he'd just push me away completely or even just keep hitting me.
text At least then I'd know where I stand with him.
text But no, every time he sees me back home from school he brightens up like an old friend is visiting and starts making small talk.
text It hurts. It hurts so much. I can't stand being home anymore...
text That's why I stay out so late now.
